        <mxCell id="dtagAIK7IoZqlTSwRLdn-13" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consideration:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§71&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- To consititute consideration a performance, or return promise must be bargained for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
