        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-0" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rejection:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 38&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An offeree&#39;s power of acceptance may be terminated by his rejection of the offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="230" x="-1440" y="1335" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-3" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lapse:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 41&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An offer may be terminated before acceptance lapse, which is defined as a reasonable time or specified by the offerer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;* Face to face conversations end an offer typically. This is from reasonable&amp;nbsp;time standard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="230" x="-1390" y="1485" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-5" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Death or Incapacity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 36&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An offer may be terminated before acceptance if the offeror dies or becomes incapacitated.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="230" x="-1470" y="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-10" edge="1" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" source="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-7" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=12;startSize=8;endSize=8;fillColor=#6a00ff;strokeColor=#3700CC;" target="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-9" value="">
