        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-7" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Revocation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 42&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An offer may be terminated, by communication of revocation, and is effective upon receipt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="230" x="-1070" y="1495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-9" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indirect Revocation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 43&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Dickenson v. Dodd)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- An offer may be terminated, by indirect means of revocation, if by a reliable source.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="230" x="-1220" y="1745" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-11" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counter - Offer:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 39&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Mirror Image Rule)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A counter - offer is an offer made by an offeree to his offeror, proposing a substituted bargain, diffirienchiating from the proposed offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="230" x="-1790" y="1335" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
