        <mxCell id="xz914e86PoCP61ma31kD-20" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Preliminary Negotiations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§26&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Owen v. Tunison)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A manifestation of willingness to enter into a bargain, is not an acceptance if the offeror knows the individual does not intend to conclude a bargain&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="200" x="-410" y="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ae_GPwFimgjY7MZPHpnK-2" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;By Silence:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§69&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- offeree takes benefit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- stated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- previous dealings or knowledge&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="210" x="-130" y="1425" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ae_GPwFimgjY7MZPHpnK-4" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Certinaty:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§33&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Even if there is offer, acceptance, consideration and the proper mutual assent, terms must be certain for a contract to be binding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="240" x="-1060" y="915" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ae_GPwFimgjY7MZPHpnK-8" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Illusory Promise&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A promise without consideration is called an&amp;nbsp;Illusory Promise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="210" x="-580" y="1860" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
