        <mxCell id="FAZBmKYACPC_W3faKcOI-21" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional terms for non merchants:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§2-207 (2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Additional terms are proposals for addition to the contract. &amp;nbsp;They drop out unless the recipient expressly agrees to them&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;*however anyone in business is a merchant in this case&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="270" x="1480" y="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FAZBmKYACPC_W3faKcOI-23" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Material alteration:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§2-207 (2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(byway refining co. V. Oxygenated)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- a Clause materially alters a contract if the new terms would result in surprise or hardships.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;* had no knowledge and no reason to know&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- arbitration clauses &amp;amp; Implied warrantability &amp;nbsp;tend to be material alteration&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- look to standard practice in field&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="195" width="340" x="2405" y="465" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FAZBmKYACPC_W3faKcOI-25" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Hill v. Gateway:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Hills made direct purchase with gateway&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- by keeping computer they accepted the terms in the box (aka gave no objection after a reasonable time.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="275" x="1205" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FAZBmKYACPC_W3faKcOI-27" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Klocek v. Gateway:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Klocek&amp;nbsp;bought through third party&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- 2-207(1) does not apply, because only one form, not a addition to new form.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- no assent to a contract&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="270" x="1540" y="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FAZBmKYACPC_W3faKcOI-29" parent="hZvGdWm9dUrXAthSrBff-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Online M&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;arketplace:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Wallace v. Tri-State Assembly&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-Amazon is an online marketplace. It did not sell,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;manufacture, distribute, or assemble the bicycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- can be strict liable for torts, not contracts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
