        <mxCell id="rK8mdNyEA7e4A7AkkcU4-34" parent="HMSoyMslVgJfamAm2t2m-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Conditions&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Is an event, not certain to occur, which must occur, unless its nonoccurrence is excused, before performance under a contract becomes due.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- When an unexcused condition can no longer occur, performance of the duty is&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;discharged altogether.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Nonoccurrence of a condition is not a breach by a party, unless he also has a duty to satisfy the condition.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="310" x="490" y="-1790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3YkD8OI5PRhBEaHH078-0" parent="HMSoyMslVgJfamAm2t2m-1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Conditions are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;strict&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Luttinger v. Rosen&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Express conditions can be satisfied only by strict compliance&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="250" x="800" y="-1560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pbd7cU_TBwBD68bYpr3c-3" edge="1" parent="HMSoyMslVgJfamAm2t2m-1" source="pbd7cU_TBwBD68bYpr3c-0" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fillColor=#6a00ff;strokeColor=#3700CC;" target="pbd7cU_TBwBD68bYpr3c-2" value="">
