        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-27" edge="1" parent="1" source="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-22" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-26" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-22" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Baby girl 2-207&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A definite expression of acceptance within a reasonable time operates as an acceptance even if new terms are stated or are different from the original.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="290" x="-420" y="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-24" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Non- Merchants&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Additional terms are proposals for addition to the contract. &amp;nbsp;They drop out unless the recipient expressly agrees to them&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;*however anyone in business is a merchant in this case&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Computer cases where keeping product from direct seller, was considered&amp;nbsp;expressly agree&amp;nbsp;to them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="380" x="-790" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-29" edge="1" parent="1" source="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-26" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-28" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-26" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Merchants&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- additional terms are proposals and between merchants will become apart of contract unless:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(1) &lt;/span&gt;the offer expressly limits acceptance to new terms (proviso Clause)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(2) &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;material alteration (surprise or hardships) (arbitration clauses &amp;amp; Implied warrantability is material )&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(3) &lt;/span&gt;objection has been given or is given within a reasonable time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="340" x="-370" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-28" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;If they continue anyway&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- conduct that recognizes a contract is sufficient to establish a contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- keep consistent terms, if terms clash knock out rule - Article 2 gap fillers take over&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="400" x="-680" y="650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-32" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Firm Offer:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;§ 2-205&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- By merchant for &lt;u&gt;goods&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- signed record (tangible or intent to be associated&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- saying it will stay open&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- not longer than 3 months&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;*is not revocable for lack of consideration&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="300" x="-170" y="630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-36" edge="1" parent="1" source="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-33" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-37" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1010" y="1070" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-33" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Statute of Frauds&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Performance over a year&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;either party can&#39;t perform in less than a year (narrowly construed, any chance within a year kills it)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lease and sale or real property&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;YEAR and a Day, not just a year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;(Does not need SOF if made payments, taken possession, ect.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;Goods $500 or more&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: (500 works) (unless&amp;nbsp;Goods are not suitable for sale elsewhere) (merchants -&amp;nbsp;10 day rule for Read Your mail )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="380" x="525" y="890" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-40" edge="1" parent="1" source="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-37" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-39" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-37" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Writing &amp;amp; Sign Requirements:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Essential Terms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Signed by D (2-201, unless objected in 10 days then considered signed)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;ALSO for $500: Need Quantity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Also:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Need not be formal&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Can be before or after&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- only quantity of goods shown in the writing&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="250" x="1010" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L7YdDY5BkAlJQfLvTlHl-39" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Other Reasons to enforce&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Promissory Estoppel&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;A promise which the promisor reasonably expects to induce action or forbearance, and does induce such action or forbearance, and injustice can only be avoided via informant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Equitable Estoppel&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: Misrepresentation or concealment of material facts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Unfairness if party is allowed to assert the truth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="310" x="1380" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-3" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Capacity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 13 - Guardianship (Void)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 14 - Infants (voidable) (Douglass v. Pflueger Hawaii)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;§ 15 - Mental Illness (voidable)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="260" x="570" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-7" edge="1" parent="1" source="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-4" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-6" value="">
