        <mxCell id="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-21" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;Warranty of title&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) &amp;nbsp;Title conveyed to Buyer is good and its transfer rightful&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) The goods are delivered free from any security interest or lien that Buyer doesn’t know about at the time of contracting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="280" x="-620" y="1790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hjc-ubePELTA_nT4U0uU-23" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;Derivative title:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- A purchaser of goods acquires all title that his transferor had&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;b&gt;Except&lt;/b&gt;: Voidable Title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- Caused by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: medium; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;/span&gt;given through fraudulent action &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- merchant who deals in a good of that kind &#x9;&#x9;(entrustment) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the seller was tricked about the buyer’s identity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the buyer paid with a check that later bounced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the parties said it was “cash sale”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- the buyer used fraud that could be criminal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Thus can be&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;can be sold&lt;/b&gt; if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(1)  Good faith purchaser &lt;br/&gt;(1.2) pays value&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
